msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Install Add-ons from Universal Media Center.tv"
msgstr "Installa Add-ons minn Universal Media Center.tv"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Download and install add-ons from the Official Universal Media Center.tv add-on repository.[CR]  By using the official Repository you will be able to take advantage of our extensive file mirror service to help get you faster downloads from a region close to you.[CR]  All add-ons on this repository have under gone basic testing, if you find a broken or not working add-on please report it to Team Universal Media Center so we can take any action needed."
msgstr "Niżżel u nstalla add-ons mir-repożitorju uffiċjali ta Universal Media Center.tv.[CR] Permezz ta' dan ir-ripożitorju uffiċjali tista' tieħu vantaġġ mis-servizz ta' file mirrors estensiv li jgħinek tniżżel l-add-ons iktar malajr minn postijiet li huma ġeografikament qrib tiegħek.[CR] L-Add-ons kollha f'dan ir-repożitorju għaddew minn testijiet bażiċi, f'każ li tinzerta xi add-on miksura jew mhux taħdem jekk jpgħġbok irrportha lil Team Universal Media Center biex inkunu nistgħu nieħdu l-azzjoni li jkun hemm bżonn."

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid "Team Universal Media Center did not make all the add-ons on this repository and are not responsible for their content"
msgstr "Team Universal Media Center m'għamilx l-add-ons kollha li hawn f'dan ir-repożitorju u mhumiex responsabbli għall-kontenut tagħhom"
